    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/65a272d2b11ad65d3f1d97d81eab5125.avif?t=1744389451\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating adventure with Pudding the Frog in this challenging physics-based precision platformer! In <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>, you'll need to master the art of jumping and grappling as you help Pudding reclaim her stolen pudding from the mischievous Harry the Heron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through multiple unique biomes with obstacles and hazards, testing your skills and reflexes at every turn. Can you guide Pudding to victory and retrieve her beloved dessert? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/0561f8df0dc929b0fece7bba9e00f853.poster.avif?t=1744389451\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/0561f8df0dc929b0fece7bba9e00f853.webm?t=1744389451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Experience tight, responsive controls that make every jump and grapple feel satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes</strong>: Feel the pressure as you climb through the world; one mistake could cost you all your progress! Learn from your mistakes and come back more prepared for your next attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful Cast of Characters</strong>: Follow Pudding's journey as she meets strange animals she would never have met by her pond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Physics Based-Grapple</strong>: Utilize Pudding's grappling hook to build tremendous speed and find your own solution to each difficult platforming challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/060c847eb0e3d005b34440363382a5ed.avif?t=1744389451\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and Playful</strong>: Tired of being a bald man in your &quot;Rage Games?&quot; Pudding frog offers a cute and colorful aesthetic to help offset that frustration you are feeling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: We promise you won't get sick of hearing the music after countless hours of falling...no way that happens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun 2D Assets</strong>: Painstakingly drawn  by mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smaller Than Life:\u00a0</strong> You are just a little frog in a great big world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Pudding on her quest and prove your mental fortitude in <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/65a272d2b11ad65d3f1d97d81eab5125.avif?t=1744389451\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating adventure with Pudding the Frog in this challenging physics-based precision platformer! In <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>, you'll need to master the art of jumping and grappling as you help Pudding reclaim her stolen pudding from the mischievous Harry the Heron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through multiple unique biomes with obstacles and hazards, testing your skills and reflexes at every turn. Can you guide Pudding to victory and retrieve her beloved dessert? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/0561f8df0dc929b0fece7bba9e00f853.poster.avif?t=1744389451\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/0561f8df0dc929b0fece7bba9e00f853.webm?t=1744389451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Experience tight, responsive controls that make every jump and grapple feel satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes</strong>: Feel the pressure as you climb through the world; one mistake could cost you all your progress! Learn from your mistakes and come back more prepared for your next attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful Cast of Characters</strong>: Follow Pudding's journey as she meets strange animals she would never have met by her pond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Physics Based-Grapple</strong>: Utilize Pudding's grappling hook to build tremendous speed and find your own solution to each difficult platforming challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/060c847eb0e3d005b34440363382a5ed.avif?t=1744389451\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and Playful</strong>: Tired of being a bald man in your &quot;Rage Games?&quot; Pudding frog offers a cute and colorful aesthetic to help offset that frustration you are feeling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: We promise you won't get sick of hearing the music after countless hours of falling...no way that happens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun 2D Assets</strong>: Painstakingly drawn  by mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smaller Than Life:\u00a0</strong> You are just a little frog in a great big world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Pudding on her quest and prove your mental fortitude in <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into Pudding Frog, a high-stakes, physics-based platformer where every leap and grapple could be your last. Master the art of the swing as you painstakingly ascend through a treacherous world to reclaim your precious pudding from the cunning Harry the Heron. Do you have what it takes?",
